      "text": "// cache path (graphify-lupa)\n~/.cache/graphify-lupa/<slug>/graphify-out/graph.json\n\n// refresh trigger (Desktop only)\nchild_process.execFile(cli, [\"extract\", root, \"--code-only\"])",
